# A COPY of the A: system card, mounted on Dual SD socket 0 (C:). The IDE/CF and SD halves read
# the SAME format (identical DPB, LBA and byte order), so one image is portable between them --
# this is that portability, shown end to end: the same bytes boot as A: on CF and read as C: on SD.
sector_size 512
sectors     769920
